@@@ note
A tight item holding a sublist must not gain a blank line before it — that promotes the whole
list to loose, and looseness is a property of the entire list, so every sibling's content
gains a <p> wrapper too. See #7.

@@@ input
- outer
  - inner one
  - inner two
- sibling

@@@ wrap 80
- outer
  - inner one
  - inner two
- sibling

@@@ wrap 20
- outer
  - inner one
  - inner two
- sibling

@@@ unwrap
- outer
  - inner one
  - inner two
- sibling
